        SettingOption(id: "pointing.enabled", section: .assistant, group: "Desktop pointing", title: "Enable desktop pointing", note: "Hold the pointing keys, ask about what is under your pointer, and Zeus rings it and answers aloud. Nothing is captured until you hold the keys.", kind: .toggle, choices: [], range: nil, defaultValue: "true", state: .live, todo: "On by default (owner decision, docs/FIRST-RUN-DEFAULTS.md). Needs your own Input Monitoring or Accessibility grant to see the keys, and Screen Recording to place marks. Zeus never prompts for these."),
        SettingOption(id: "pointing.shortcut", section: .assistant, group: "Desktop pointing", title: "Pointing keys", note: "Control-Option is also the Talk to Zeus key: one hold is one Zeus turn that speaks in the Zeus voice and can point at the screen. Pick Right Option or Fn for a separate pointing turn that draws while held.", kind: .choice, choices: ["Control-Option", "Right Option", "Fn (Globe)"], range: nil, defaultValue: "Control-Option", state: .live, todo: "One hold, one turn (docs/VOICE-KEY.md). Control and Option is VoiceOver's modifier: while VoiceOver is on, Talk to Zeus moves to Option + Command and pointing on Control-Option pauses."),
